OL,3,GNEWSAVillage roads flooded after
OL,4,A'torrential' downpours
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristopher Bishop, who has lived in
OL,7,Fthe village for about 15 years, said
OL,8,Fthe rain was "torrential" and he had
OL,9,F"never seen it like that for probably
OL,10,F20 odd years".
